Internet-Draft draft-ietf-tls-key-share-prediction-05.txt is now available. It
is a work item of the Transport Layer Security (TLS) WG of the IETF.

   Title:   TLS Key Share Prediction
   Author:  David Benjamin
   Name:    draft-ietf-tls-key-share-prediction-05.txt
   Pages:   7
   Dates:   2026-10-15

Abstract:

   This document defines a mechanism for servers to communicate
   supported key share algorithms in DNS.  Clients may use this
   information to reduce TLS handshake round-trips.

The IETF datatracker status page for this Internet-Draft is:
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-tls-key-share-prediction/

